# Jackpot Service: every endpoint, runnable from IntelliJ IDEA (HTTP Client) or VS Code (REST Client extension).
#
# Start the stack first: docker compose up --build   (API on :8080, actuator on :8081)
# Host run with the default H2 profile (./mvnw spring-boot:run): the actuator is on :8080, change @managementUrl.
#
# Bet ids are idempotency keys: a bet id that was already processed is a no-op. To replay the walkthrough on the
# same running stack, bump @run.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@managementUrl = http://localhost:8081
@run = 1

### Jackpots | list (pools, cycles, policies)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/jackpots
Accept: application/json

### Jackpots | one jackpot
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/jackpots/jackpot-lucky
Accept: application/json

### Jackpots | unknown -> 404 JACKPOT_NOT_FOUND
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/jackpots/jackpot-does-not-exist

### Lucky WON demo | place 250.00 on jackpot-lucky -> 202 Accepted + Location
# On a fresh jackpot-lucky: 20 % of 250.00 = 50.00 -> pool 150.00 >= poolLimit 150 -> win chance 100 %.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/bets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "betId": "http-lucky-{{run}}",
  "userId": "user-42",
  "jackpotId": "jackpot-lucky",
  "betAmount": 250.00
}

### Lucky WON demo | evaluation -> WON 150.00 (404 BET_NOT_FOUND until the consumer processed the bet)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/bets/http-lucky-{{run}}/evaluation

### Lucky WON demo | contribution -> 50.00, currentJackpotAmount 150.00
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/bets/http-lucky-{{run}}/contribution

### Lucky WON demo | the processed bet -> status CONTRIBUTED
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/bets/http-lucky-{{run}}

### Lucky WON demo | the jackpot after the win -> pool reset to 100.00, cycle + 1
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/jackpots/jackpot-lucky

### Normal bet | place 100.00 on jackpot-fixed (5 % contribution, 1 % win chance)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/bets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "betId": "http-fixed-{{run}}",
  "userId": "user-42",
  "jackpotId": "jackpot-fixed",
  "betAmount": 100.00
}

### Normal bet | evaluation (LOST in 99 % of the runs)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/bets/http-fixed-{{run}}/evaluation

### Normal bet | contribution -> 5.00
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/bets/http-fixed-{{run}}/contribution

### Normal bet | same bet id again -> 202, but the consumer ignores it (DUPLICATE); the pool does not change
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/bets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "betId": "http-fixed-{{run}}",
  "userId": "user-42",
  "jackpotId": "jackpot-fixed",
  "betAmount": 100.00
}

### Unknown jackpot | place a bet (the API does not check the jackpot, the consumer does)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/bets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "betId": "http-unknown-{{run}}",
  "userId": "user-42",
  "jackpotId": "jackpot-does-not-exist",
  "betAmount": 10.00
}

### Unknown jackpot | the bet -> 200, status NO_MATCHING_JACKPOT
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/bets/http-unknown-{{run}}

### Unknown jackpot | evaluation -> 422 BET_NOT_CONTRIBUTING
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/bets/http-unknown-{{run}}/evaluation

### Unknown jackpot | contribution -> 422 BET_NOT_CONTRIBUTING
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/bets/http-unknown-{{run}}/contribution

### Errors | 400 VALIDATION_FAILED (errors sorted by field, then message)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/bets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "betId": "",
  "userId": "user 42",
  "jackpotId": "jackpot-fixed",
  "betAmount": 0.001
}

### Errors | 400 MALFORMED_REQUEST (body is not a valid PlaceBetRequest)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/bets
Content-Type: application/json

{ "betId": "http-bad-{{run}}", "betAmount": "lots" }

### Errors | 400 MALFORMED_REQUEST (strict parsing: a duplicate key is never last-wins)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/bets
Content-Type: application/json

{ "betId": "http-dup-{{run}}", "userId": "user-42", "jackpotId": "jackpot-fixed", "betAmount": 1.00, "betAmount": 999.00 }

### Errors | 400 VALIDATION_FAILED on a path variable (ids must match ^(?!\.{1,2}$)[A-Za-z0-9._:-]{1,64}$)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/bets/bad!id

### Errors | 404 BET_NOT_FOUND (unknown, or not consumed yet)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/bets/never-placed-{{run}}

### Errors | 404 RESOURCE_NOT_FOUND (unknown URL)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/nothing-here

### Errors | 405 METHOD_NOT_ALLOWED (+ Allow: GET)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/jackpots/jackpot-fixed

### Errors | 406 NOT_ACCEPTABLE (rejected before the handler runs, so nothing is published)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/jackpots
Accept: application/xml

### Errors | 415 UNSUPPORTED_MEDIA_TYPE
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/bets
Content-Type: text/plain

hello

### Docs | OpenAPI 3.1 document (Swagger UI: http://localhost:8080/swagger-ui.html)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v3/api-docs

### Ops | health with details (db, kafkaListeners, diskSpace, ...)
GET {{managementUrl}}/actuator/health

### Ops | liveness probe
GET {{managementUrl}}/actuator/health/liveness

### Ops | readiness probe
GET {{managementUrl}}/actuator/health/readiness

### Ops | Prometheus scrape (business metrics start with jackpot_)
GET {{managementUrl}}/actuator/prometheus

### Ops | one metric
GET {{managementUrl}}/actuator/metrics/jackpot.bets.processed
